{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>In the book of the wars of YHWH with Vahev in Suphah.</b> It will be recounted to YHWH for a generation, together with the rest of His wars." "<b>Vahev in Suphah, and the wadis of Arnon.</b> That portion of Arnon through which Israel passed in peace — and Sihon did not then rise against them — He gave them Vahev in Suphah, and the wadis which the blessed El at that time set as a storm wind and an outpouring of many streams, which prevented Sihon from coming to rise against them."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:40:30.016091523Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}